sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 第三方客户端
    participant Express as Express Server
    participant Routes as routes-api-v1.mjs
    participant FS as server/data/

    Client->>Express: GET /api/v1/status?chapter=vol1-ch1
    Express->>Express: securityHeaders (安全响应头)
    Express->>Express: rateLimit (IP 限流 60/min)
    Note over Express: /api/v1 白名单<br/>跳过 requireSignature
    Express->>Routes: 路由分发

    Routes->>FS: readJSON('tasks.json')
    FS-->>Routes: tasks[] (全部章节)

    alt ?chapter= 存在
        Routes->>Routes: tasks.filter(t => t.chapter === query)
    else 无筛选参数
        Routes->>Routes: 保留全部章节
    end

    Routes->>Routes: 计算 summary<br/>(total / completed / translating / pending)
    Routes-->>Express: { code: 0, data: { chapters, summary } }
    Express-->>Client: JSON 200 OK (&lt; 50ms)
